{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32155","headline":"会昌丙寅丰岁歌 · 温庭筠","name":"会昌丙寅丰岁歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丙寅岁，休牛马。\n风如吹烟，日如渥赭。\n九重天子调天下，春绿将年到西野。\n西野翁，生儿童。\n门前好树青䒠茸，䒠茸单衣麦田路。\n村南娶妇桃花红，新姑车右及门柱，粉项韩凭双扇中。\n喜气自能成岁丰，农祥尔物来争功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}